  "usage_note": "Only the head noun 'jalgpallikoondis' declines; 'Eesti' stays in the genitive as an attribute. The illative also has the long form 'jalgpallikoondisesse', but sports press normally uses 'jalgpallikoondisse'. In running copy the team is usually called 'Eesti' (Eestit, Eestiga, Eesti vastu) or 'Eesti koondis' (koondise, koondist, koondisse). The fuller variant 'Eesti meeste jalgpallikoondis' declines the same way, with 'meeste' left unchanged."
